{"items":[{"id":"365245119","root":"365244165","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"这就给您表演一个鲤鱼打挺跃龙门[emot=acfun,1689/]","time":1608610035475,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"365246115","root":"365244165","user":{"id":"28245228","name":"瑟心","avatar":"e35269a298449ed181bd9f79"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1680/]啥子叫老骨头[emot=acfun,1685/]","time":1608610727868,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"365335761","root":"365244165","user":{"id":"150674","name":"BachG","avatar":"ca27cd53adf2ffee6c281681"},"text":"是黑粉，快扑杀[emot=acfun,1685/]","time":1608631166097,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"365343652","root":"365244165","user":{"id":"23503115","name":"暮雪清峭","avatar":"ea65659a13fff0ae15cb4476"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1689/]水龙王名不虚传，当年一跃而起冲出龙门 ，才有今天的样子[emot=acfun,1918/]","time":1608635298104,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"365344167","root":"365244165","user":{"id":"23503115","name":"暮雪清峭","avatar":"ea65659a13fff0ae15cb4476"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1689/]“老骨头”这自黑名词还是水姐自己说的，你应该关注水姐比较晚，印象中是两月前的动态，水姐貌似签约了A站然后打了鸡血说拼了这把老骨头云云，我还调侃老骨头多少钱一斤，卖不卖。[emot=acfun,1793/]水姐对A站更多的是感恩，她好多失去的在这里慢慢都找回来了，我就不说太深了，容易被人带节奏，所以这“老骨头”不是调侃，只是关心水姐要注意休息，最近忙的连直播都没时间播[emot=acfun,1788/]就不多解释啥了[emot=acfun,1734/]懂得都懂","time":1608635737090,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"瑟心","replyToUserId":"28245228","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}],"media":{"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-